# Options of the YoRHa-OS boot screen (contracts/plymouth-theme.md); the first value is the default.
# The Plymouth script can't read files, so gen/embed-stages.py copies these values into
# yorha-os.script: run it after a change, then rebuild the initramfs.
#   exit     fast = the list fades out in 0.4 s | game = the game's 0.9 s (costs 0.5 s of boot)
#   effects  full | calm = no interference bands, tear or flicker (reduced motion)
#   typing   instant = each line shows whole as its stage arrives (spec 012) | game = typed as in the
#            game's boot (77 letters/s, 0.11 s between lines)
#   debug    off | on = a frame-rate counter in the corner (lab only)
exit=fast
effects=full
typing=instant
debug=off
